- [x] Confirm peer listener/worker path can checkpoint after peer RPC while the process is still starting.
- [x] Confirm peer-RPC checkpoint calls are serialized only when routed through the new durable_checkpoint_lock helper.
- [x] Confirm startup checkpoint calls bypass that helper/lock after the peer listener is already active.
